## Overall System

The workflow transforms **Telegram into an AI-powered conversational calendar interface**, allowing users to manage their schedules without interacting directly with the Google Calendar interface.

The combination of **Telegram + OpenAI + AI Agent + Memory + Google Calendar** enables a natural, conversational scheduling experience that supports both **text and voice-based interactions**.
